Ben, most Optimus laptops have no physical output for the Nvidia GPU. 
Oddballs like the Dell XPS line have the HDMI ports connected to the GPU 
and Asus laptops have the MXDS/MXMX mux for the LVDS.

Come to the #bumblebee-dev channel on Freenode if you want any 
additional resources. We're eager to help.

- Eric
